 <h3><u>Haan tunjo matam</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><u><font size=4><strong></strong></font></u></p>
  <p><u><font size=4><strong>Haan tunjo matam</strong></font></u></p>
  <u><font size=4><strong> </strong></font></u>
  <p><font size=4>Munjo marshid maula sayi, Maula sayi, Ay momin-e jee pehchaan</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Nabiyal jee ibadat aa matam, (Momin jee shifa'at aa matam) x2 kar gham bhar ke salmaan</li>
    <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p>
    <li>Tu ayaa huwe ibne haider, (sehwar jagir ali akber) x2 momin jee wadae shaam</li>
    <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p>
    <li>zehra ki dua tera matam, (har gham ki dua tera matam) x2 bakshish ka banaa samaan</li>
    <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p>
    <li>jab yaad aaye phat ta hai jigar (wo shaame ghariban ka manzar) x2 karte the haram yakjaan</li>
    <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p>
    <li>Din raat bhi matam karte hai (aur chand sitare rote hai) x2 karta hai falak har aah</li>
    <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p>
    <li>the ahle haram paband rasn, (karti thi buka har gham behen) x2 barpa tha sare zindan</li>
    <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p>
    <li>lashe pe tere sab rote the, (barpa maktal me karte the) x2 ho teero tabar paikaan</li>
    <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p>
    <li>ghazi ke lahu me duba alam (aur zere alam sab ehle haram) x2 karte the baka har aan</li>
   </ol> <p>(haan tunjo matam maula sayi) x2 ay momin-e jee pehchaan</p></font>
